# T_SCRE: the tabs refused with "save first" while the item form holds
# unsaved changes: the Record menu in an edited form and its Parts,
# Service records and Loans and holds in a new item's form; the edited
# form is left with Esc after agreeing to lose the changes, the
# untouched new form with Esc alone.
K CTRL-E TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB CTRL-Y
T M07-B rev 2
K ALT-C
S SAVEF5
K ALT-C
S SAVEF6
K ALT-C
S SAVEF7
K ESC
S LOSEQ
T Y
K INS ALT-C P
S NEWF5
K ALT-C S
S NEWF6
K ALT-C A
S NEWF7
K ESC
S BACK
K ESC
